<title>INDIA: India TISCO 96/97 first half sales up.</title>
<headline>India TISCO 96/97 first half sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private steel maker Tata Iron and Steel Company (TISCO) said on Tuesday its steel sales and output rose in the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>TISCO said saleable steel output rose to 1.36 million tonnes during April-September 1996, from 1.34 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Steel sales climbed to 1.126 million tonnes in the first six months of 1996/97, from 1.036 million tonnes a year ago.</p>
</text>
